# Which cmd-shims checks this repository runs, where a reviewer sees it.
#
# This repo is public and holds the rule that reads the running machine's
# identity, so every example in its own docs is written from some maintainer's
# workstation. no-os-identity calls back into this engine's --check-text mode:
# the guard on the way out is the same rule as the guard on the tree.
no-os-identity
prevent-ai-author
